ysport for RISC OS.

- riscos/ysriscosspecialpath.cpp: the program directory is <YSFlight$Dir>
  (set by !Run); user, documents and application data are
  <Choices$Write>/YSFlight, created on first use.
- riscos/ysopenurl.cpp: YsOpenURL hands the URL to URI_Dispatch.
- riscos/ysriscoserror.cpp: YsRiscOsInstallErrorReport(). On SIGEMT (a
  data abort and the like) or SIGOSERROR it writes the RISC OS error, which
  UnixLib's own report leaves out, and UnixLib's backtrace to stderr, then
  _exit(2). Same approach as riscos-openttd's patch 15.
- The rest is the Linux code (UTF-8 encoding, file I/O, timer).

For YSCE ysce_public 1b13297. See docs/PORTING-NOTES.md in riscos-ysflight.

